OL,3,GNEWSABurnham suggests Welsh Labour lost
OL,4,Asight of devolution as review
OL,5,Acriticises ex-first minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe prime minister has told members of
OL,8,Fhis party that Welsh Labour may have
OL,9,Flost sight of some of the principles of
OL,10,Fdevolution before it was thrown out of
OL,11,Fpower in a historic election defeat.
OL,13,FOn Saturday morning Andy Burnham
OL,14,Faddressed the first Welsh Labour
OL,15,Fconference since May's Senedd election.
OL,17,FHe suggested the previous Labour
OL,18,Fgovernment did not do enough to pass
OL,19,Fpowers down to communities, and said it
OL,20,Fwas "hard" to accept the party was no
OL,21,Flonger in power after 27 years of
OL,22,Frunning the Welsh government.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
