OL,3,GNEWSABurnham suggests Welsh Labour lost
OL,4,Asight of devolution as review
OL,5,Acriticises ex-first minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe spoke before a review into what went
OL,8,Fwrong concluded that former First
OL,9,FMinister Eluned Morgan's political
OL,10,Fstrategy of calling out Westminster
OL,11,Fplayed a role in the party losing
OL,12,Fpower.
